# Prefix: Mods.SkillBar (from filename)

Keybinds: {
	SkillSlot1.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 1
	SkillSlot2.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 2
	SkillSlot3.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 3
	SkillSlot4.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 4
	SkillSlot5.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 5
	SkillSlot6.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 6
	SkillSlot7.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 7
	SkillSlot8.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 8
	SkillSlot9.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 9
	SkillSlot10.DisplayName: Item Bar Slot 10
}

DragHint: Drag to move item bar
NotUsable: That item cannot be placed on the item bar.
BlockedItem: Yoyos and flails cannot be used from the item bar. Use your hotbar for those weapons.
NoResources: Not enough mana or materials to use that item.
Assigned: Assigned {0} to item bar.
EmptySlot: That item bar slot is empty.
NeedInInventory: You need that item in your inventory to use it from the item bar.
SlotCleared: No {0} left in inventory — removed from item bar.
NoMana: Not enough mana.
CannotUse: Cannot use that item right now.
UseFailed: Could not use that item. Aim at the world and make sure you have mana or ammo.
OnCooldown: That item is still on cooldown.
CannotPlace: Cannot place there. Aim at a valid spot within reach.
OutOfRange: That location is out of placement range.
NothingToMine: Nothing to mine or chop there. Aim at a block, tree, or wall.
KeybindHelp: Item Bar — press Z for slot 1, or set keys in Mod Config. Hold the key for channel weapons (flamethrower, etc.).
InputReady: Item Bar input active. Slot 1 key is {0}. Enable debug in config to log presses.
SlotPressed: "[Item Bar] Slot {0} ({1}) via {2}"
UseOk: "[Item Bar] Mining tile ({0}, {1})"
UseDebugFail: "[Item Bar] Use failed ({0})"
UseCrashed: "[Item Bar] Error: {0}"
